WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.340
Welcome to Launched Global. So this is a video on how to download project file and upload project file.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:13.360
First, you will receive the email from Launched Global through projectatlaunch.org.mailID.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:19.120
Scroll down the message. You will be reaching this document, which is attached to this mail ID.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:25.700
If you open the document, you will be having this all the project material over there and download

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:31.680
the file. Now head over to the files where you have just downloaded the zip file and right click,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:38.300
click on extract all and choose your location and finally click on extract. That's it. Now you can

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:44.760
work on your project. This was about how to download project file. Now we will see how to submit

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.520
the project. Head over to the same mail where you receive the project. Now click on submit your

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.160
project demonstration. You will be reaching Google Form where you have to fill some details.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:01:02.900
After filling every detail, click on next. Here you upload document project Google Drive Link

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:08.860
and past here the Google Drive link of demonstration video. And share the link to your LinkedIn

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:14.700
post where you have uploaded the demonstration video. Upload your project Google post here.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.400
Now click on checking box and finally click on submit. That's it. This is how you should submit

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.760
the project. If you have any query, please contact to support.

